      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just being tired though. it’s the realization that the \"fight\" is just going to go on forever. no matter how much i learn or how much i try to be okay, the world just makes it impossible. it feels like i'm just choosing to suffer over and over again for no reason. does that even make sense? it feels so pointless.",
